{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50452","headline":"六四 · 王梵志","name":"六四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"逢争不须看，见打莫前僞。\n（「僞」，伯三六五六卷作「爲」。\n）{扌|厶/贝}即追友胜，（「{扌|厶/贝}」，伯三七一六、伯三六五六作「捐」。\n项楚校作「损」。\n）证能惣不知。\n（「证能」，伯三五五八、伯三七一六、伯三六五六、斯二七一○卷作「能胜」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50452.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50452","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}